<!--
Codifies performance indexes that already exist on the production database
(reverse-engineered from a phpMyAdmin dump, 2026-09-01) but were never captured
in a changeset, so a fresh install would silently miss them. Each changeSet is
guarded by an indexExists precondition (onFail="MARK_RAN") so it is a no-op on
a database that already has the index, and only creates it on a fresh/older one.

Also adds an index for FKT_DOCUMENTRECEIVER.ORIGINCONTACTID, which backs
DocumentsDAO#findInvoicesForContact()/#findPaidInvoicesForContact() (join on
this column) but has never been indexed.

TODO: consider adding a real FOREIGN KEY constraint for
FKT_DOCUMENTRECEIVER.ORIGINCONTACTID -> FKT_CONTACT.ID once it's confirmed the
live data has no orphaned values (contacts that were hard-deleted while
documents referencing them still exist). Deferred for now - index only.

FKT_DOCUMENT.FK_CONTACT / FK_DELIVERYCONTACT / CONSULTANT are legacy columns
from the pre-2.1 schema, superseded by FKT_DOCUMENTRECEIVER's address-snapshot
approach and unused by current code. Left untouched here on purpose (no drop).
-->

    <changeSet author="dvorpahl" id="20260901-001" objectQuotingStrategy="QUOTE_ALL_OBJECTS">
